Error [E2914]: `#Reactive fn` must not return a value
  --> tests/ui/reactive_fn_returns_value.jet:1:14
    |
  1 | #Reactive fn bad() Int -> { return 1 }
    |              ^^^
 Why: `#Reactive fn` lowers to a reactive effect scope — effects don't produce a value (D-REACTCORE1)
 Fix: Drop the return type, or use `#Reactive { … }` inside a plain `fn`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2914
